    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "step-2",
      "heading": "Prepare the beans",
      "blocks": [
        "Trim the beans. Toss with a drizzle of oil, salt and pepper on a sheet of foil and seal it into a parcel."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
      "image": {
        "id": "honeyed-nduja-chicken-traybake-2-sketch",
