        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "id": "step-3",
      "heading": "Start the beans and season the chicken",
      "blocks": [
        "Put the bean parcel on one side of a tray and roast on the middle shelf for 20–25 minutes in total. Meanwhile, season the chicken and rub with honey and vegan ’nduja to taste."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Roast the beans",
          "seconds": [
            1200,
            1500
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "honeyed-nduja-chicken-traybake-3-sketch",
        "path": "media/honeyed-nduja-chicken-traybake-3-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Start the beans and season the chicken",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "step-4",
      "heading": "Bake the chicken",
      "blocks": [
        "When the beans have about 15 minutes left, add the thighs to the tray alongside the parcel. Return to the oven and roast for 16–18 minutes until the chicken is browned and cooked through and the beans are tender."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Roast the chicken",
          "seconds": [
            960,
            1080
          ]
        }
